nt</highlight> i.e. fix (late use) tents <ref ref=\"Dan 11:45\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"45\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"45\" onclick=\"bcv(27,11,45)\">Dan 11:45</ref> <bdbheb>מַשְׂמְרוֺת נְטוּעִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Eccl 12:11\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(21,12,11)\">Eccl 12:11</ref> <highlight>nails planted</highlight>, i.e. fixed in; even <bdbheb>אֹזֶן</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 94:9\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"94\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"94\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(19,94,9)\">Ps 94:9</ref> <highlight>he that, planted</highlight>, the <highlight>ear</highlight>. <b>Niph`al</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 3 plural <bdbheb>נִטָּ֑עוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 40:24\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(23,40,24)\">Isa 40:24</ref> <highlight>be planted</highlight>, figurative, = be established. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Num 24:6", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 24, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Deut 6:11", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 6, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Jer 12:2", "book": "JER", "chapter": 12, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Jer 45:4", "book": "JER", "chapter": 45, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Jer 42:10", "book": "JER", "chapter": 42, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Eccl 2:5", "book": "ECC", "chapter": 2, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Jer 2:21", "book": "JER", "chapter": 2, "verse": 21}, {"raw": "2Sam 7:10", "book": "2SA", "chapter": 7, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "1Chr 17:9", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 17, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Amos 9:15", "book": "AMO", "chapter": 9, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "Dan 11:45", "book": "DAN", "chapter": 11, "verse": 45}, {"raw": "Gen 2:8", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 2, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Isa 5:2", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 5, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Deut 16:21", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 16, "verse": 21}, {"raw": "Ps 80:9", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 80, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Exod 15:17", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 15, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "Ps 44:3", "book": "PSA", "